# Pueblo Cantera (M5-D, contract 26), 22 x 22. column = i, row = j. The Bosque Umbrio arrives from the south (j = 21, screen down-left),
# the east exit (i = 21, screen down-right) is Ruta 3 (C2: a real two-way warp since contract 31): a man blocks it until the Medalla Cantera (flag 80), afterwards the corridor
# leads to Ruta 3 (spawn `south`). Look: gravel ground, rock-wall cliffs ring the town instead of trees, stone houses with slate roofs, boulders, the pick-and-shovel
# sign, mine rails with an ore cart (decoration). Centro (door z), tienda (door m), the Rock gym (door g), two decorative stone houses, four townsfolk with hints.
# Memory: each map costs less than Ciudad Nodo (contract 5.x): gravel / rails are mask-free (bg 0), few distinct sprites, the cliffs are 3 variants of one 1 x 1 piece.
@map pueblo_cantera
@size 22 22
@interior no
@area pueblo_cantera
@fly 2 pueblo_cantera 4 14 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 2 = visited flag 986 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fill gravel_a
@spawn south 10 20 N            # arriving from the Bosque Umbrio
@spawn centro_door 4 14 S       # in front of the Centro door
@spawn tienda_door 17 14 S      # in front of the tienda door
@spawn gym_door 10 5 S          # in front of the gym door
@spawn puas_door 4 5 S            # F2 (contract 74): in front of the first stone house (the hedgehog lover)
@spawn cuadra_door 16 19 S        # F2: in front of the second one (the rider)
@spawn east 20 10 W             # behind the blocker: where Ruta 3 arrives (C2); also what keeps the warp tiles "reachable" for mapc (the blocker is a solid NPC)
@spawn museo_door 17 5 S         # (contract 80): in front of the museum's door
@flag badge_cantera 80          # the Medalla Cantera (party.h FLAG_BADGE_FIRST): set by Garrick (gimnasio_cantera.map), hides the blocker
@legend
  .  tile=gravel                  # quarry gravel, 3 variants
  =  tile=path_a                  # the streets
  C  tile=gravel_a object=cliff   # rock wall (3 variants), the border of the town
  R  tile=rails_a                 # mine rails along +i (walkable)
  D  tile=rails_a object=cart interact=look script=find_cart     # the ore cart on the rails (solid)
  b  tile=gravel_b object=boulder
  o  tile=path_a object=boulder   # the boulder that closes one lane of the east corridor
  s  tile=gravel_c object=pickaxe_sign interact=look text=cantera.sign
  Z  object=center
  z  door=center
  M  object=mart
  m  door=mart
  G  object=gym_cantera
  g  door=gym_cantera
  H  object=stone_house
  h  door=stone_house            # F2 (contract 74): casa_puas
  K  object=stone_house
  k  door=stone_house            # F2: casa_cuadra
  1  tile=gravel_b npc=vecino_m id=hint_gym face=NW text=cantera.npc.gym
  2  tile=gravel_a npc=vecino_m id=hint_quarry face=SE script=rumor_cantera
  3  tile=gravel_c npc=vecino_m id=hint_center face=NE text=cantera.npc.center
  4  tile=gravel_a npc=vecino_m id=hint_east face=SW text=cantera.npc.east
  B  tile=path_a npc=guardia id=blocker face=NW script=blocker hide_flag=80
  U  object=stone_house
  u  door=stone_house            # (contract 80): the museum (museo_cantera), the same stone house as the two others, flanked by pillars
  P  tile=gravel_a object=pillar
  S  tile=gravel_b object=sign interact=look text=extra.museum.sign
  X  tile=path_a                                               # the road to Ruta 3 (warp, C2)
  d  tile=path_a
  I  tile=gravel hidden=rich_salve   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  CCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCC
  CCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCC
  C.................I..C
  C..HH....GGG.b..UU...C
  C..Hh....GgG...PUuPS.C
  C.........==.1.......C
  C......b..==..RRRDRR.C
  C.........==.........C
  C.........==.......CCC
  C.....b...=========o=X
  C.....2...=========B=X
  C.........==.......CCC
  C..ZZZ....==..4.MM...C
  C..ZzZ....==....Mm...C
  C...===============..C
  C......3..==.......b.C
  C.....b...==.........C
  C.........==...KK....C
  C.........==...Kk....C
  C........s==.b.......C
  C.........==.........C
  CCCCCCCCCCddCCCCCCCCCC

@warp d -> bosque_umbrio spawn=north
@warp z -> centro_cantera spawn=door
@warp m -> tienda_cantera spawn=door
@warp g -> gimnasio_cantera spawn=door
@warp h -> casa_puas spawn=door
@warp k -> casa_cuadra spawn=door
@warp u -> museo_cantera spawn=door
@warp X -> ruta_3 spawn=south
# The man at the east exit: talking to him says so and pushes the hero back one step.
# The Medalla Cantera hides him (hide_flag 80); the corridor then leads to Ruta 3 (warp X).
@script blocker npc
    npc_face_hero blocker
    say cantera.blocker
    hero_walk NW 1
@end
# D1 (contract 68): the second Origin Fragment lies in the ore cart (the old line of the quarry man first, then the rumor + the clue).
@script rumor_cantera npc
    npc_face_hero hint_quarry
    say cantera.npc.quarry
    say d1.cantera.rumor
    setf legend_rumor
@end
@script find_cart interact
    jf frag_2 empty
    say d1.cart.look
    give_item origin_shard 1
    jv 0 0 full
    setf frag_2
    sfx item
    say gl.d1.got
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  empty:
    say d1.cart.empty
@end
